    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταθμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quartered</i>
			<i>on another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				3p.41
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιῶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					880.61
				</span></i>
			 (Pizus, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>): neut. pl. as
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταθμα, τά</span>, <i>quarters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.173
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταθμος, ὁ</span>, <i>quartermaster,
			satrap</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.120
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Καρίας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				162
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				253
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. <i>image
				placed at a door</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2146.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμποσίαρχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.612c
			</span></i>.</div>
